[{"id":"d21eb84","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"7de85d8","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"28e11e5","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_5828-600x810.jpg'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_5828-1536x865.jpg' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_5828.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Sahara Desert Adventure</div><span class='et-eye'>Desert · 3 days</span><h1>Sahara Desert Adventure</h1><p class='lead'>Short but unforgettable: high Atlas passes, dramatic gorges and the golden Erg Chebbi dunes.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Sahara%20Desert%20Adventure%20(3%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>3 days</b><span>2 nights</span></div><div><b>Marrakech</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Marrakech</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Marrakech</span><span>Ait Benhaddou</span><span>Ouarzazate</span><span>Dades</span><span>Todra Gorge</span><span>Erfoud</span><span>Erg Chebbi</span><span>Nkob</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Marrakech · Ait Benhaddou · Ouarzazate · Kelaat Mgouna · Boumalen Dades</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Early departure in the morning from Marrakech via the spectacular Tizi N’Tichka pass (2260 m). The beautiful mountain road with unforgettable scenery is the highest road in the country. Before Ouarzazate we pay a short visit to discover Ksar Ait Ben Haddou (UNESCO World Heritage).</p><p>After a visit to Ouarzazate — the Hollywood of Morocco — for a brief stop at Atlas Film Studios and Kasbah Taourirt, we continue on the Road of a Thousand Kasbahs to Kelaat M’gouna. Overnight stay in a traditional hotel in Boumalen Dades.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Boumalen Dades · Tinghir · Todra Gorges · Erfoud · Dunes of Erg Chebbi (Merzouga)</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive through Dades Valley and traditional Berber villages, then continue to Tinghir and stop at the famous Todra Gorge — towering cliffs over 300m high beside lush palm groves. We proceed via Erfoud, land of fossils and palm oases, toward the dunes of Merzouga.</p><p>Enjoy the ever-changing colors of the desert; then mount camels for a peaceful trek into the heart of Erg Chebbi. Watch a magical sunset over the dunes and spend the night in a luxury tent under a starry sky with traditional dinner and music.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Erg Chebbi · Alnif – Nkob · Ouarzazate · Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Rise early for sunrise over the dunes and a final camel ride back to the village. After breakfast, set out by car through ever-changing landscapes — oases, plateaus and rocky passes. Travel via Alnif and Nkob, cross the Draa valley region, then return to Ouarzazate and climb Tizi N’Tichka pass back to Marrakech, arriving in the afternoon/evening. End of the Sahara Desert Adventure.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Every itinerary can be adapted — start date, number of days, hotels and stops. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>3 days / 2 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Marrakech</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Marrakech</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>Desert</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Sahara%20Desert%20Adventure%20(3%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a><a class='et-btn et-btn-o' href='mailto:epictravelmorocco@gmail.com?subject=Sahara%20Desert%20Adventure'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-mail'/></svg>Email us</a><a class='et-btn' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/contact-2/'>Send a request</a><small>WhatsApp +212 661 292 596 · Tel +1 579 484 7707</small></div></div></aside></div><